<section class="section"><div class="container prose"><h2>There is a general period and reduced periods</h2><p>The residence period for Spanish nationality by residence is not the same for every applicant. The general period is longer, while the law provides reduced periods for specific nationalities and circumstances.</p><h2>Check your nationality and residence history</h2><p>The relevant period must be checked together with the legal character and continuity of residence and the other requirements of the application.</p><p><a href="https://www.mjusticia.gob.es/en/ciudadania/nacionalidad/adquisicion-nacionalidad-residencia" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Check the Ministry of Justice information →</a></p></div></section>
